Changes to sing-box v1.14.4 (GNU GPL v3.0 or later), made by the unbraid authors, last on 2026-11-10:
A connection test or a Tailscale sign-out that overlaps a reload or a stop returns an error instead of
stopping the engine, and configuration checks release the WireGuard and OpenVPN devices they built.
Applied by tools/build-libbox.sh; git apply skips these lines.

